[en.IDEA_C09_SATELLITE_3]
Satellite State

[en.IDEA_C09_SATELLITE_3_desc]
The only reason why the Sire’s Hollow can maintain its independent development without interference is definitely not because it is powerful or special, but simply because it is the border between the Changeling Empire and the Equestria Empire.
Remember, do not forget your position. Weakness and ignorance are not barriers to survival, but arrogance is.

[en.IDEA_C09_SATELLITE_3_TOOLTIP]
§RCannot train units, disband units, or edit unit templates.§!

[zh.IDEA_C09_SATELLITE_3]
卫星国

[zh.IDEA_C09_SATELLITE_3_desc]
名流谷之所以能够保持其独立发展不受干扰，绝对不是因为它强大或是特殊，仅仅是因为它是幻形灵帝国与小马利亚帝国博弈的边界。
切记，不要忘记自己的位置。弱小和无知，不是生存的障碍，傲慢才是。

[zh.IDEA_C09_SATELLITE_3_TOOLTIP]
§R无法训练部队、解散部队或编辑部队编制。§!
